-- Misconception codes added with the measures question templates (clock reading, ruler start, volume).
--
-- The whole registry is upserted, so this migration is safe to run on a database that already has the
-- earlier codes. It is generated from src/lib/misconceptions/registry.ts
-- (`npx tsx scripts/misconceptions-sql.ts`); tests/db/misconceptions.test.ts keeps the two identical.
-- A question's misconception tags are validated against this table by a trigger (migration 0014).

on conflict (code) do update set
  name = excluded.name, description = excluded.description,
  topic_code = excluded.topic_code, remediation = excluded.remediation;
